  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AarogyaSeva&apos;s Mental Health Initiative is a holistic approach that promotes awareness about mental health issues, provides medical support and reduces stigma and discrimination of people with mental illnesses. Through this initiative and similar such partnerships in the future we aim to promote mental wellness and destigmatize mental illnesses.   Covid 19 has left us taking several steps behind in this effort and significantly affected numerous frontline workers.</narrative>
  </description>
